{
  "name": "Large area light (phase3a 3.33.0 item 2.4): a 360x240 cm LTC rectangle 200 cm above a rough floor, a 50x50x60 cm box standing on it and a free-standing wall; DXR area-source shadows (default ON) versus unshadowed versus the path tracer",
  "version": "1.0",
  "entities": [
    {"name": "Camera", "components": {
